Center, Basra University, Al- Garma campus, using 500 ml
glass bottles, during April 2018. Samples putted in ice box
and transfer to the lab where saved under cooling 4 ºC till
be used. The feed used in these ponds not contain any
bacterial additive, and it was confirmed that no additional
supplements were added to feed of fish in these ponds.
